# Repo-specific index excludes (gitignore-style; see internal/filter).
# Mirrored third-party reference source — not our code.
ref/
# In-tree vendored agentic-kit mirror (ADR-019) — upstream's code, indexed as
# its own fleet service already; ingesting it here duplicates symbol names
# against internal/semantic and friends, poisoning callgraph resolution for
# our own code (the exact index-pollution bug class handoff-H1 fixed for
# .claude/worktrees — see docs/dogfood-observations.md).
third_party/
# Gitignored scratch: converted design docs, tracking.
tmp/
# Local DuckDB stores and runtime artifacts.
workspace/
bin/
# A stray `go build -o fathom ./cmd/fathom` at repo root (build artifacts
# belong in bin/ or workspace/, never root) used to line-count as 423K lines
# of "other". Connectors now also detect binaries by content (NUL-byte sniff,
# ADR-021 §1 / LT-2), but this entry keeps it out of the walk entirely.
/fathom
